</think>
<action>
{"tool": "read_chunk", "path": "x.py"}
<think>! Need more evidence. → continue.</think>
</action>
```

Reason: reopened/embedded `<think>` inside `<action>`.

```
<think>
! Patch target confirmed. → write file.
</think>
<action>...</action>
<file_content>
<think>! Notes. → continue.</think>
actual file content
</file_content>
```

Reason: `<think>` inside `<file_content>`.

